{"identifier":"HowtoGoP1954","title":"How to Go Places","description":"Actress Gale Storm and family take a road trip in their Chevrolet and review the do's and don'ts of auto traveling.","videoUrl":"https://archive.org/download/HowtoGoP1954/HowtoGoP1954_512kb.mp4","thumbnailUrl":"https://archive.org/services/img/HowtoGoP1954","sourcePageUrl":"https://archive.org/details/HowtoGoP1954","durationMs":617001,"level":"B2","topic":"Tourism;Travelogues;Car culture: General","sourceCredit":"Source: Internet Archive — How to Go Places","hasCaptions":true,"segments":[{"startMs":0,"endMs":33000,"text":"[...] Cope City Nowhere the Lee Bonnell family of Hollywood is going?"},{"startMs":34000,"endMs":39001,"text":"Vacation That wonderful American institution of going new places and doing new things."},{"startMs":41000,"endMs":45000,"text":"The vacation baggage is all packed and the family car is in tip-top shape."},{"startMs":45001,"endMs":47001,"text":"All checked and ready to go places."},{"startMs":48000,"endMs":52001,"text":"The Bonnells consider themselves experts on how to go places in the family car."},{"startMs":53001,"endMs":57001,"text":"Part of the job of being an expert is knowing how to get ready to go."},{"startMs":57001,"endMs":62000,"text":"Last vacation this expert left the lawn sprinklers running."},{"startMs":64001,"endMs":68000,"text":"This expert forgot to leave a note for the milkman."},{"startMs":69000,"endMs":72001,"text":"So this year the experts have a checklist."},{"startMs":73001,"endMs":76001,"text":"The checklist makes it easy to know what to take."},{"startMs":77000,"endMs":80000,"text":"Of course it also makes it easy to know what not to take."},{"startMs":82000,"endMs":87000,"text":"With the family baggage all together on display anyone can do a good job of packing."},{"startMs":89000,"endMs":90001,"text":"A neat trick."},{"startMs":91000,"endMs":95001,"text":"When the things you'll want first are the last to be packed they'll be easier to find."},{"startMs":97000,"endMs":98000,"text":"And here's a tip."},{"startMs":98001,"endMs":107000,"text":"One bag holding toilet articles, pajamas and a change of light clothing for the entire family can save a lot of unpacking and repacking."},{"startMs":108000,"endMs":112000,"text":"Lee takes an expert's pride in keeping the passenger spaces clear and unobstructed."},{"startMs":112001,"endMs":119001,"text":"But even so blocking that door on the traffic side is a good safety precaution if you're traveling with children."},{"startMs":120001,"endMs":130000,"text":"There's a small cushion or two for sleepy heads and to help stretch distances between stops a jug of water some cookies and dried fruit for between meal"},{"startMs":130000,"endMs":131001,"text":"snacks without mess and bother."},{"startMs":138001,"endMs":148001,"text":"Last item on the Bonnell's checklist and a good idea for everyone a spare key for the car safely tucked away in a magnetic container for emergencies."},{"startMs":150000,"endMs":155001,"text":"Yes when it comes to getting ready to go a real expert seems to think of everything."},{"startMs":156001,"endMs":159000,"text":"Philip are you sure you step a lock on the front door when you close it."},{"startMs":159000,"endMs":161000,"text":"Yes that it's locked."},{"startMs":162001,"endMs":168000,"text":"Oh I just remembered something my purse where is it it's on the dining room table."},{"startMs":169000,"endMs":172000,"text":"Okay give me the keys I'll go get it."},{"startMs":173000,"endMs":178001,"text":"I hate to tell you this but that's where all the house keys are in my purse."},{"startMs":185000,"endMs":186000,"text":"[...]"},{"startMs":183000,"endMs":195000,"text":"The open road at last ready to go places thanks to three small boys with hidden talent for burglary only half an hour"},{"startMs":195000,"endMs":200000,"text":"behind schedule and who cares about schedules when their vacation bomb."},{"startMs":202000,"endMs":208001,"text":"Apparently pop does but stepping on it is not the expert way to make up for lost time."},{"startMs":210000,"endMs":219001,"text":"The faster he goes the fewer the miles on a tank full of gas much of the time he thinks he is saving by extra speed may actually be spent in extra refueling stops"},{"startMs":219001,"endMs":226001,"text":"speed is expensive for the average car driving costs increase rapidly as"},{"startMs":226001,"endMs":228000,"text":"driving speeds go up."},{"startMs":228001,"endMs":230000,"text":"So take it easy."},{"startMs":230001,"endMs":239001,"text":"That's right you'll get there more economically more safely and probably just as soon if you drive at an efficient rate."},{"startMs":241000,"endMs":246001,"text":"Traveling at a steady reasonable speed will let you cover more miles in a day relaxed and comfortable."},{"startMs":249000,"endMs":254001,"text":"Experts make time by watching for ways to avoid business traffic in cities and towns."},{"startMs":257000,"endMs":263001,"text":"They plan their trips to avoid rush hour traffic at morning noon and evening in large cities on their route."},{"startMs":265001,"endMs":276001,"text":"Here's a time saver that works two ways whenever possible combine all your requirements for service such as gasoline regular checks of oil tires and cooling"},{"startMs":276001,"endMs":278001,"text":"system in a single stop."},{"startMs":279000,"endMs":287000,"text":"Then you'll find you have plenty of time to get refreshment exercise and local information on highway conditions."},{"startMs":289001,"endMs":296001,"text":"Knowing how to get"},{"startMs":296001,"endMs":306000,"text":"where you are going is one of the most important ways of saving time but remember it's so easy to get poor advice from people you just"},{"startMs":306000,"endMs":307001,"text":"happened to meet along the road."},{"startMs":309000,"endMs":311001,"text":"Yep down that way."},{"startMs":312001,"endMs":315000,"text":"Least wise he thinks so."},{"startMs":320000,"endMs":324000,"text":"Hey wait the other way the other way."},{"startMs":327001,"endMs":328000,"text":"Oh well."},{"startMs":340000,"endMs":343001,"text":"I'm confused I'm hungry I'm thirsty."},{"startMs":344001,"endMs":353000,"text":"And I'm positive that old coot told us this was the shortcut to the main highway there's something written on that sign up there"},{"startMs":353000,"endMs":355000,"text":"I'll get out and see what it says."},{"startMs":359000,"endMs":367000,"text":"No matter where you think you are."},{"startMs":369001,"endMs":371001,"text":"You are lost."},{"startMs":374000,"endMs":385000,"text":"With a good map highway navigation can be very simple next time you travel try marking the route with two pencil lines and closing the highway the arrows"},{"startMs":385000,"endMs":387001,"text":"call attention to important information."},{"startMs":390000,"endMs":399001,"text":"Some travelers use the map to make an ingenious guide list of route numbers and key mileage is for a long trip the list is broken into sections each covering a"},{"startMs":399001,"endMs":401000,"text":"map or a section of a map."},{"startMs":402001,"endMs":408001,"text":"When the guide list is handy to the steering wheel you can check off the route changes as you make them."},{"startMs":410001,"endMs":415000,"text":"Then you'll always know where you are and what to look for to keep you on the road."},{"startMs":418001,"endMs":427000,"text":"A knowledge of direction often helps you get where you are going did you know that you can use your watch as a compass if the sun is shining."},{"startMs":429001,"endMs":431001,"text":"Point the hour hand directly at the sun."},{"startMs":433001,"endMs":443000,"text":"Midway between the hour hand and twelve o'clock is approximately so that's all there is to it."},{"startMs":444001,"endMs":449001,"text":"However you'll find it pays to have a compass if you do a great deal of traveling in open country."},{"startMs":451000,"endMs":458000,"text":"When you're going places knowing how to get ready to go and how to get where"},{"startMs":458000,"endMs":465001,"text":"you're going are important but knowing how to relax and have fun while you're going is most important of all."},{"startMs":466000,"endMs":477000,"text":"A good driver becomes steadily more alert and more efficient during the first three or four hours behind the wheel after four hours of driving his efficiency"},{"startMs":477000,"endMs":480000,"text":"usually begins to drop unless he knows how to relax."},{"startMs":482000,"endMs":488001,"text":"The safest and most relaxed grip on the steering wheel is with the hands in what the experts call the ten twenty position."},{"startMs":491000,"endMs":498001,"text":"You'll cover more miles that arrive feeling more refreshed with your back straight and your head up than if you slouch behind the wheel."},{"startMs":500000,"endMs":505000,"text":"An occasional change in the position of the driver's seat also helps you stay comfortable and alert."},{"startMs":512001,"endMs":521000,"text":"Cross country travel can be a rewarding experience for the whole family but there are times when young passengers need something besides scenery"},{"startMs":521000,"endMs":522001,"text":"to keep them happy and occupied."},{"startMs":523001,"endMs":529000,"text":"Here is a game that's fun for all. How far is it to that mountain ahead?"},{"startMs":529001,"endMs":534000,"text":"Each member of the family guesses and the closest guest scores a point."},{"startMs":535000,"endMs":544001,"text":"Many familiar parlor games become more enjoyable because they're played in a parlor on wheels, spelling games and guessing games and license plate games"},{"startMs":544001,"endMs":546001,"text":"inspired by the passing scene."},{"startMs":549001,"endMs":557001,"text":"On any cross country vacation trip, the real expert is the one who takes the time to discover America."},{"startMs":561000,"endMs":569000,"text":"East or west, north or south, the awe-inspiring wonders of the Grand Canyon of the Colorado."},{"startMs":571000,"endMs":585000,"text":"The spectacular beauty of Zion National Monument, mighty Niagara, the sparkling waters of the Atlantic,"},{"startMs":588000,"endMs":596000,"text":"the historic Southland, all these and a thousand more within your easy reach."},{"startMs":597000,"endMs":602000,"text":"Isn't America wonderful? And our vacation is wonderful too?"},{"startMs":603001,"endMs":608001,"text":"We're the boys. We've come hundreds of miles to see all of this. Why aren't they out here to enjoy it?"},{"startMs":609000,"endMs":612001,"text":"Oh, they're back in the car planning next summer's vacation. They're reading a book."},{"startMs":614001,"endMs":617001,"text":"I think the title is, How to Go to the Moon."}]}